    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You ward yourself against destructive energy, reducing the damage you take by 4d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.</p><p>If the triggering damage came from a creature within range, you can force it to make a Constitution saving throw, taking 4d6 Force damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> Both the damage reduction and the Force damage increase by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 4.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-aoTp1YdAy0gSDC8H\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Damage Reduction</em> rolls the amount to subtract from the damage you take.</p></section>",
